From 274869d5609409dd8173a9aa3aed239ca1e7ad27 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Daniel Campos Ramos <Capitain_Jack@yahoo.com>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 23:44:47 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] autotests: Require stereo output mode in every screenshot
 reply

Cover all seven ScreenShot2 methods, both interactive kinds, ordinary and declared windows, and composing/2D output controls. Check native eye geometry and pixels separately from mode metadata.

Assisted-by: Codex (GPT-6)
---
 autotests/integration/CMakeLists.txt          |   1 +
 .../integration/screenshot_reply_test.cpp     | 195 ++++++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 196 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 autotests/integration/screenshot_reply_test.cpp

diff --git a/autotests/integration/CMakeLists.txt b/autotests/integration/CMakeLists.txt
index 4f320b4..ef733da 100644
--- a/autotests/integration/CMakeLists.txt
+++ b/autotests/integration/CMakeLists.txt
@@ -165,6 +165,7 @@ integrationTest(NAME testAlphaModifier SRCS alpha_modifier_test.cpp)
 integrationTest(NAME testStereoContent SRCS stereo_content_test.cpp)
 integrationTest(NAME testStereoDepthExchange SRCS stereo_depth_exchange_test.cpp)
 integrationTest(NAME testScreenshotStereo SRCS screenshot_stereo_test.cpp LIBS screenshot_test_support)
+integrationTest(NAME testScreenshotReply SRCS screenshot_reply_test.cpp LIBS screenshot_test_support)
 integrationTest(NAME testStereoDepthPinned SRCS stereo_depth_pinned_test.cpp LIBS screenshot_test_support)
 integrationTest(NAME testStereoDepthPinnedStack SRCS stereo_depth_pinned_stack_test.cpp LIBS screenshot_test_support)
 integrationTest(NAME testOutputOrder SRCS output_order_test.cpp)
diff --git a/autotests/integration/screenshot_reply_test.cpp b/autotests/integration/screenshot_reply_test.cpp
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..4bbc41f
--- /dev/null
+++ b/autotests/integration/screenshot_reply_test.cpp
@@ -0,0 +1,195 @@
+/*
